# Secrets / credentials — never commit
src/flighty_mcp/build_token.txt

# The deployment host checks this repository out and runs docker compose from
# the checkout, so both of these sit in the working tree there. .env holds the
# account bearer and the build token; data/ holds the database snapshot, which
# is the account's flight history even with the Account row stripped.
.env
data/

